# Cursor Usage

## Spec-first · scoped tasks

- ⬜ Fill [`contract-brief.md`](mdc:documents/ai/templates/contract-brief.md) or link CANON spec before code
- ⬜ One PR purpose per session when possible ([`pr-plan.md`](mdc:documents/ai/templates/pr-plan.md))
- ⬜ "plan only" / "audit only" → **no production edits**; tests-only when scoped
- ⬜ Task prompt includes **Position · Authority · Acceptance · Stop conditions** ([`AGENTS.md`](mdc:AGENTS.md))

