## Memo

- Recurring mistakes → `documents/CURSOR_MEMO.md` when user requests (date + reason).

## Multiple chats

- New thread per PR purpose or topic change.
- Conclusions from another chat: re-verify against files + CANON spec.

## Bugbot

- [bugbot-policy.mdc](mdc:.cursor/rules/bugbot-policy.mdc) — selective, not default on every PR.

